+    <section class="connections" aria-labelledby="connections-title">
+      <h2 id="connections-title">Connect your coffee equipment</h2>
+      <p>Check a local device or the Daily Grind companion app. Your browser may ask for access to your local network or this computer. Only connect to equipment you trust.</p>
+      <p id="secure-context-error" role="alert" hidden>Connections require this page to be served over HTTPS. Open the secure version of this site before connecting.</p>
+      <div class="grid">
